h-shiji043-046:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p066","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"代相","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m066-0026","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"官稱、任命與敘事王號分存；不由卒、首次用稱或迎立代推所有任期。「五國相王」趙獨否保留，先前武靈王用稱不等於此年受王號。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji043-050","person_id":"cbr-p002400","title":"代相","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p072","quote":"二十年，王略中山地，至寧葭；西略胡地，至楡中。林胡王獻馬。歸，使樓緩之秦，仇液之韓，王賁之楚，富丁之魏，趙爵之齊。代相趙固主胡，致其兵。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji043-050:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p072","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"代相","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m072-0059","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"明示授予、自號及廢太子與敘事用稱分開；分趙而王章的未決計畫不是授予。死亡與傳國不推所有官爵終點，回敘太子不補曆日。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji043-171","person_id":"cbr-p002400","surfaces":["趙固"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p066","quote":"十八年，秦武王與孟説舉龍文赤鼎，絶臏而死。趙王使代相趙固迎公子稷於燕，送歸，立爲秦王，是爲昭王。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p072","quote":"二十年，王略中山地，至寧葭；西略胡地，至楡中。林胡王獻馬。歸，使樓緩之秦，仇液之韓，王賁之楚，富丁之魏，趙爵之齊。代相趙固主胡，致其兵。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、是為與連續事件；太戊午／大戊午暫接但字形待底本核查。娃嬴／孟姚／惠后按本段明示暫接，不與先前夢辭孟姚按同名合併；王紲與較早公子紲分候選。君王職稱按各國上下文辨別，不全域匹配。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p066","text":"十八年，秦武王與孟説舉龍文赤鼎，絶臏而死。趙王使代相趙固迎公子稷於燕，送歸，立爲秦王，是爲昭王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first